# Build Resources Directory

This directory contains application icons and assets for Electron builds:

- `icon.ico` - Windows application icon (256x256 or larger)
- `icon.icns` - macOS application icon (512x512 or larger)
- `icon.png` - Linux application icon (512x512 or larger)
- `entitlements.mac.plist` - macOS entitlements for code signing

## Icon Requirements

### Windows (.ico)
- Format: ICO file with multiple sizes embedded
- Recommended sizes: 16x16, 32x32, 48x48, 64x64, 128x128, 256x256
- Tool: Use online converters or ImageMagick

### macOS (.icns)
- Format: ICNS file with multiple sizes embedded
- Recommended sizes: 16x16, 32x32, 128x128, 256x256, 512x512, 1024x1024
- Tool: Use `iconutil` on macOS or online converters

### Linux (.png)
- Format: PNG file
- Size: 512x512 pixels
- Transparency: Supported

## Creating Icons

You can create icons from a single high-resolution PNG (1024x1024) using:

```bash
# macOS
iconutil -c icns icon.iconset

# Windows (using ImageMagick)
convert icon.png -define icon:auto-resize=256,128,64,48,32,16 icon.ico

# Linux
cp icon-512.png icon.png
```

## Placeholder

Until actual icons are provided, electron-builder will use default Electron icons.
